      "entries": [
        "Takatorra unleashes a flurry of attacks. Takatorra makes five melee Strikes. Their multiple attack penalty applies as normal. They gain a cumulative +2 circumstance bonus to damage for each successful Strike. If one target is hit with at least two of these Strikes, they also take 2d6 persistent bleed damage. They then become stunned|CRB|stunned 1 and flat-footed until the start of their next turn."
